      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crittenden%2C_Kentucky",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Crittenden County was created on April 1, 1842, from part of Livingston County.",
